Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《木乃伊归来》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:37.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,(底比斯 公元前3067年)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:40.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,五千年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five thousandyears ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,一名骁勇擅战的武士魔蝎大帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a fierce warrior known as the Scorpion King...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,率领大军企图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Led a great army on a campaign...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,征服世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to conquer the known world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:14.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,经历了长达七年的战役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After a vicious campaign which Lasted seven Long years...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:16.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,魔蝎大帝的军队大败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Scorpion King and his army were defeated...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:20.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,一路溃退至神圣的沙漠 阿姆谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and driven deep into the sacred desert ofAhm Shere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:45.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个接着一个 他们慢慢地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One by one, they slowly perished...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,倒了下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under the scorching sun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:53.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,只剩下这名伟大的武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}untiL only the great warrior himself was left alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:02.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,临死之前…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Near death...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:06.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,魔蝎大帝向死神阿努比斯立誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Scorpion King made a pact with the dark godAnubis...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要阿努比斯肯饶他一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that ifAnubis wouLd spare his life...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:12.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,让他征服敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Let him conquer his enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:15.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,他愿意交出他的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would give him his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:26.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿努比斯答应了他的请求 饶他不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anubis accepted his offer and spared his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:49.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,(阿姆谢绿洲)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:56.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,魔蝎大帝率领阿努比斯的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anubis gave the Scorpion King command ofhis army...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,大军如洪水般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Like an eviL flood, they washed away...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:04.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all that Lay before them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:16.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,在他达成目的以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When his task was done...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:20.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿努比斯按照约定取走他的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anubis forced the Scorpion King to serve him for all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:31.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的军队则回到原来的沙地之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His army was returned to the sands from whence they came...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:39.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们耐心的在地下 等待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where they wait, silently...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:42.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,再度重返人间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be awakened once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:45.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,(1933年 埃及)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:20.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:23.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你以为木乃伊复活了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you thi nki ng. a m um my had come back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:25.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有空再告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I 'll tell you a story some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:28.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你下来干嘛? 我不是叫你待在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing down here? I told you to wait for us in the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:30.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是我… - 别可是 下面很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But. Dad. I saw… - No "buts." It's dangerous down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是我看到你的刺青 - 看到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I saw your tattoo. - You saw what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,门口的墙上有一样的螺旋形装饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On a wall by the entrance. There's a cartouche just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,有金字塔 有眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the pyramid and the eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:41.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有帝王 完全一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the two kings and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:43.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:46.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,好 我等一下再上去看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Well. I'll be up to take a look at that in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:49.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有 我要你回上面等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the meantime. I wantyou to wait for us up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:51.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,东西拿好 我等一下上去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick upyour stuff. and I'll seeyou up in the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:56.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我要做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:07:00.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 随便你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:03.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 盖个好一点的捕鼠机 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Build a better mousetrap. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:05.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,趁你妈忙着挖别人的墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whileyour mother goes and desecrates another tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:27.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那有毒的 - 除非被它们咬到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Those are poisonous. you know. - Only ifthey biteyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:29.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was all that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:31.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 艾力克斯有东西要我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. nothing. Alex wanted to show me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:37.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,这小鬼越来越像你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the kid gets more and more likeyou every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:39.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是指越来越有魅力 越可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What. you mean more attractive. sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:41.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有越来越迷人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and devilishly charming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:44.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是 他要把我逼疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. he's driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,做到哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now. where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:49.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,锤子和凿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hammer and chisel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:56.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,好啦!好啦!照你的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. all right! Let's do ityourway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thankyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:18.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,自从我开始梦到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since I had that dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我心里…就一直想个不停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this place is all I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:25.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,自从你开始做梦 我就没好好睡过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever sinceyou had that dream. I haven't had a decent night ofsleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:29.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我以前来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:31.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我有来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:34.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙 这地方至少 三千年没人来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy. nobody's been here before. not in at least 3.000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:36.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了这些家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:44.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我为什么会知道路?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how do I seem to know exactly where I'm going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:00.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:37.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,请问…有人在家吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock. knock. Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:42.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个在这边找找看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two check out that stuff. see if it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:46.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我去搞定欧康纳他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll sort out the O'Connells.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:22.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗?再快一点 你就可以写字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know. ifyou move that fast enough. you can almost write your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:25.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看到东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just had a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:27.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,和我梦到的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like my dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:29.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是更真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.49,0:11:31.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我好像回到了古代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Itwas like I was actually here in ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:34.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是那样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. ifyou actuallywere here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:37.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦你告诉我这门怎么开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could you show me how to open this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:38.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:57.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我被你吓到了 - 我自己也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nowyou're starting to scare me. - I'm starting to scare myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:01.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?全是一堆垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? Look at the state ofthis rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:03.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,搞不清楚状况的埃及人 什么嘛!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Egyptians never had a clue. Look at that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:06.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,根本就是一堆便宜货 我的妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all chintz and stuff. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:11.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,烂陶器 还有没用的废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheap pottery. this. Ancient rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:16.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 有东西打到我的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacques. something's hit me head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 史皮威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Spivey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,这地方有诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:25.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要把神给吵醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want to wake the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是魔蝎大帝的徽章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the emblem ofthe Scorpion King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:51.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,他应该只是虚构的人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's supposed to be pure myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:54.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,以前从来没有找到他的记录 没有史前器物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No trace ofhim has ever been found before. No artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.47,0:12:57.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,也没有文献资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No archival evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们不希望他被找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they didn't want anybody to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得这样做不太好 - 只是一个箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't have a good feeling about this. - It's only a chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:07.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开箱子不会有坏处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No harm ever came from opening a chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:09.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊!读书不会有坏处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. and no harm ever came from reading a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:12.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 结果怎么样 - 别这样 我们不能半途而废\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember how that one went? - Come on. We can't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:14.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,记住我是有道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember. I was the voice of reason here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:15.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:17.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:20.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,废物 便宜货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dreck. Chintz.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:21.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有一半…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only half ofthis…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:27.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,天哪!痛死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God. that hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:49.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,老婆 用你的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon? Let's do ityourway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:10.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,死神之镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bracelet of Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:21.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,交给我处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care ofthis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:28.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在放回去有用吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit late for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:35.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 放进你的背包里 - 不要 把它放回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put it in your rucksack. - Let's leave it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:37.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 已经来不及了 - 上面写什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a bit late for that! - What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,凡打扰手镯者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He who disturbs this bracelet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,必饮尼罗河之水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shall drink from the Nile."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:44.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,听起来还好嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't sound too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:07.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,小子 杰克会好好修理你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacques is gonna make a nice fillet out ofyou. my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:10.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:13.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,史皮威 杰克 我们快闪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spivey!Jacques! Let's get the hell out ofhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:15.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:18.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙 这次糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bad. Evy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:21.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们以前也碰过 - 这次更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've had bad before. - This is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:01.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom? Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:04.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们听我解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:17.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,(哈姆纳塔 亡灵之城)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,亡灵黑经起死回生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Book ofthe Dead gives life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:37.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,而太阳金经…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Book ofthe Living...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.03,0:17:42.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,转生为死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}takes life away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:44.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为那是我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that was myjob.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:49.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们快找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.83,0:18:21.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you acquire it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:33.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,就快要找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:50.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:55.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,找到他了 我们找到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found him! We found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:14.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,让开 别挡路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step aside there. Out oftheway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:21.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莫顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:23.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他 是伊莫顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him. It's Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.06,0:20:31.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们要招回他的僧侣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nowwe must raise those that serve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,滚开 别挡着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out ofmyway. Get out oftheway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:35.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,让开 不然我一枪打死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out ofmyway or I'm gonna shootyou in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:38.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是说真的 他以前干过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He means it. He shot someone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,东西拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.91,0:20:42.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,出了一点状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The opportunity passed us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:47.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们需要那只手镯 - 我们要有手镯才能开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need that bracelet. - We need it before it opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:53.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,哈夫兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Hafez...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.26,0:21:01.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说过应该交给我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I should have handled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:04.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望你的过去 让事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not want your past history...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,变得更复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to cloud the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会搞定 我们知道在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. We know where it is. We'll take care ofit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:11.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用 我们自己会搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. we'll take care ofit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:14.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有别的事要你去办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a different chore foryou now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:15.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,手镯在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the bracelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:17.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,在去伦敦的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on its way to merry old London.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:22.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就去伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then London is where we must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:42.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为手镯可以带路去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the bracelet is some sort ofguide...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,失落的绿洲 阿姆谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the lost oasis of Ahm Shere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:47.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙 我知道你在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy. I know what you're thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:49.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,答案是"不行"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the answer's no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.27,0:21:51.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们才刚到家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:54.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是有这点好处 我们不用收拾行李了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the beauty of it. We're already packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:58.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,可不可以掰一个更好的理由?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don'tyou just give me one good reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:22:00.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,那只是一座绿洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just an oasis...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,老公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:06.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}exciting...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:10.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,浪漫的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}romantic...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.47,0:22:15.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,绿洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}oasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:19.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,那种有白沙滩 棕榈树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kind with the white. sandy beach and the palm trees...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:21.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有清澈的湖水?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the cool. clear. blue water?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:26.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以喝那种 上面插一把雨伞的饮料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have some ofthose big drinks with the little umbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:30.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 听起来很棒 - 听起来太棒了 有什么风险?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sounds good. - Sounds too good. What's the catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.65,0:22:33.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是阿努比斯军队的安息地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposedly it's the resting place ofAnubis's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:35.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,看吧!我就知道没这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? I knew there's a catch. There's always a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.89,0:22:37.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道?猜也猜得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I know that? And let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.25,0:22:40.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,军队是由那个魔蝎大帝指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was commanded by that Scorpion King guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.59,0:22:42.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 但是他每五千年才会醒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. but he only awakens once every 5.000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:46.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且要是没人杀死他 他就会摧毁全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if someone doesn't kill him. he's gonna wipe out the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:49.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道? - 我不知道 但是每次都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you know? - I didn't. but that's always the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:52.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,最后一支抵达阿姆谢的远征队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last known expedition to actually reach Ahm Shere...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:56.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,是拉美士四世 在三千年前派出去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was sent by Ramses the Fourth over 3.000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:59.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他派了一千多人出去 - 但是没有一个人回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He sent over a thousand men. - None ofthem was ever seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:01.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道? - 我不知道 但是每次都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you know? - I didn't. but that's always the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:03.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我提过纯金的金字塔吗? - 第二次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I mention the pyramid of gold? - Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.55,0:23:05.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,亚历山大大帝派军队 去寻找阿姆谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexander the Great sent troops in search ofit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝他好运 - 还有凯撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hooray for him. - So did Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:09.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看他的下场 - 还有拿破仑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lookwhat happened to his career. - And Napoleon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:12.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我们比他聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. but we're smarter than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:12.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 也比他高 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Taller too. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:17.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以我们一定会找到 - 因为我们够高?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's whywe're gonna find it. - Because we're taller?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:21.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以我才会爱上你 - 少来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's why I love you. - Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.35,0:23:43.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.02,0:23:45.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,箱子要怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do with this chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.69,0:23:48.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,死箱子妈的重死人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suckerweighs a goddang ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.19,0:23:50.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 不准说脏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex. watch your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:52.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,箱子非常的重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ratherweighty. this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.11,0:24:05.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是六个星期前 开始做那个怪梦的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy. that first weird dream ofyours was exactly six weeks ago. right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.94,0:24:08.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊!那有什么关系吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. but what's that got to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:12.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,那时候正好是埃及的新年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just happens to coincide with Egyptian New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.45,0:24:13.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,(蝎年)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:16.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错耶!真巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.42,0:24:20.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.09,0:24:22.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们该小心一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I'm saying is let's be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.47,0:24:34.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要是出事 我永远不会原谅我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifanything happened toyou. I would never forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.59,0:24:58.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在意的只有你和艾力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Alex are the only thing that matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.13,0:24:59.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,其实…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.80,0:25:04.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,班桥学者一直在求我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Bembridge scholars have been begging me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.27,0:25:06.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,管理大英博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to run the British Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.92,0:25:26.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!要怎么脱掉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cripes. how doyou get this thing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.59,0:25:28.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我今天亲过你没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I kissed you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.57,0:25:40.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我最讨厌你这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate it when you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.07,0:25:41.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.54,0:25:44.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 害我什么都答应 - 真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Makes me agree to anything. - Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:52.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我的内衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those knickers are not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:56.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.42,0:25:58.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,儿子 乖五分钟行不行?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex. behave yourself for five minutes. all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.69,0:26:01.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.93,0:26:13.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 回家高兴吗? - 非常高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Happy to be home? - Couldn't be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.34,0:26:15.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,今年是蝎年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Year ofthe Scorpion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.87,0:26:17.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 酷哦! - 我想你会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Neat. - Thoughtyou might like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.81,0:26:22.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以我杀了木乃伊和他的手下 然后拿了他的权杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I killed the mummy and his minions and stole his scepter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.31,0:26:23.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. you're so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:26.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且富有 我提过吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And rich. Did I mention rich?
