Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.06,0:26:34.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 我们一定是走错了 - 你不是说这是你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. we must be in the wrong house. - You said this was your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:36.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没说 - 打电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't. - Call me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.03,0:26:40.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不是席拉的先生吧? - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not Sheila's husband? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.77,0:26:44.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是强尼的手下 我星期二就会还钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifyou work forJohnny. I was gonna pay him back on Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.30,0:26:46.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识什么强尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know anyJohnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.57,0:26:48.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在找死神之镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are looking for the bracelet ofAnubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.01,0:26:51.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,有品位 值得收藏 阿努比斯牌的手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. good foryou. Good thing to have. the old bracelet of Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:53.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,手镯在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.61,0:26:56.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是来找手镯的 原来如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. you're looking here for the bracelet. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.41,0:26:58.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea whatyou're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.85,0:27:01.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,欧康诺先生 我的耐性有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. O'Connell. you try my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.99,0:27:04.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,欧康诺先生?等一下 你认错人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. O'Connell? Hold on a minute. You've got the wrong ma
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.89,0:27:07.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,那只手镯 想起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bracelet. Now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.33,0:27:10.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我打牌输掉了 - 我希望你最好没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I lost it in a card game. - Foryour sake. I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:17.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.34,0:27:25.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你太太呢?- 我太太?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's yourwife? - Mywife?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.84,0:27:28.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是指伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Evy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.61,0:27:31.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想她不是去德国就是去西藏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she went offto Baden-Baden orTibet or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.88,0:27:35.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,她喜欢到处跑 我提过我单身吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl's a free spirit. Did I mention I was single now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:44.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,埃及眼镜蛇相当的毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Egyptian asps are quite poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.56,0:27:46.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,在楼下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.73,0:27:52.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,有个保险箱 密码是32058…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a safe. The combination is 3-20-58.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.54,0:27:53.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,393什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}393-something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:55.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,在楼下保险箱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in the safe downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.94,0:27:57.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you!
