Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.34,0:28:02.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 意思是我都说了 你们不能杀我 - 我们什么时候答应过?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you soyou wouldn't kill me. - When did we make that arrangement?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.03,0:28:16.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森 跟你说过 不准有疯狂派对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan. I thought I said no more wild parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.39,0:28:18.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,受欢迎嘛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. when you're popular…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.66,0:28:21.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是说真的 钥匙丢了你就别想出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious. Ifyou've lost that key. you're grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.03,0:28:25.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没弄丢 我只是找不到 那不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't lost it. I just can't find it. There's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:27.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你最好快点找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. you better start finding it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.04,0:28:30.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会 妈 别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will. Mom. There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:33.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.78,0:28:38.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?怎么会在我家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who areyou? What areyou doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.48,0:28:40.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是来找箱子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for the chest. of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.22,0:28:44.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,把箱子给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:50.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去 这是我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my house.
