Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:54.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这主意不太好 - 艾力克斯 到后面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe not the best idea. - Alex. get back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:29:00.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,这主意果然不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely not the best idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.51,0:29:02.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得该叫爸来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's time to yell for Dad now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.91,0:29:05.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我就杀了你们再拿箱子 - 不见得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will kill you and take it anyway. - I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:11.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿德贝?你怎么会来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ardeth. What areyou doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.18,0:29:13.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,待会儿再解释好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps explanations are best kept for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.25,0:29:14.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿德贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ardeth Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:16.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,洛克纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock-Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.02,0:29:19.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,各位 虽然我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. folks. knowing my brother-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.19,0:29:21.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是他自找的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he probably deserves whatever you're about to do to him
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.46,0:29:22.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,但这是我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this is my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.93,0:29:25.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢蛇 也不喜欢死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have certain rules about snakes and dismemberment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.33,0:29:30.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.93,0:30:00.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,哇!妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:03.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么时候学的? - 我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where did you learn to do that? - I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.31,0:30:10.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,这几招是和你爸学的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I learned from your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.38,0:30:15.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.49,0:30:27.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,不错嘛!法老侍卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad for a Medjai.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.20,0:30:35.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.44,0:30:47.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 箱子里放了什么? - 死神之镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's in the chest? - The bracelet of Anubis!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:04.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能让他们拿到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must not get the bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.23,0:31:06.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,快带着箱子走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it and get out ofhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.40,0:31:14.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈!小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom. Iook out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.21,0:31:16.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evelyn!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:21.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.25,0:31:28.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.62,0:31:31.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan?
