Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.76,0:31:39.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't done anything to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.87,0:31:43.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 最近吗? - 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lately. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.96,0:32:06.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.96,0:32:09.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out. Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.47,0:32:21.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.41,0:32:24.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:27.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,欧康诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Connells
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.98,0:32:32.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的来干嘛? 算了 我不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing here? Scratch that. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.78,0:32:34.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,那些是什么人? 他们要带我太太去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are those guys and where are they taking mywife?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.99,0:32:37.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend. I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.99,0:32:39.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是你太太…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but wherever this man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:41.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,一定在他手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yourwife will surely be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.59,0:32:46.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认得他 他是馆长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I know him. He's the curator.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.50,0:32:49.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 大英博物馆的馆长 - 你确定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He works at the British Museum. - Areyou sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.10,0:32:52.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,最好相信他 他在博物馆的时间比在家多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better believe him. He spends more time there than he does at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.34,0:32:56.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你来了 坏人也来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. you're here. The bad guys are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.94,0:32:57.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙被绑架 换言之…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy's been kidnapped. Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.91,0:33:01.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 怪物被他们从墓穴挖了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They once again removed the creature from his grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.08,0:33:04.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不是要怪你 你不是应该要看好他的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to point fingers. but isn't ityour job to make sure that doesn't happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.42,0:33:07.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,和他一起的那个女人 知道普通人不可能知道的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That woman with him knew things no living person could possibly know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.89,0:33:10.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,她知道怪物确实的埋葬地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knew exactlywhere the creature was buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.42,0:33:13.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望她会带我们找到手镯 果然没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hoped she would lead us to the bracelet. She obviously did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.66,0:33:15.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在他们得手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now they have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.33,0:33:18.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我倒不会那么紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't get too nervous justyet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.49,0:33:20.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是金的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.66,0:33:23.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一戴上就看到吉萨的金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I stuck it on. I saw the pyramids at Giza.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.30,0:33:26.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后"咻"的一声 就越过卡纳克沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then whoosh straight across the desert to Karnak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.47,0:33:29.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,你戴上手镯引起的连锁反应 会带来末世的启示录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have started a chain reaction that could bring about the next apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.37,0:33:33.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你 放轻松 你 倒霉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Iighten up. You. big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:35.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,你 上车去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.85,0:33:44.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉吓到你儿子 但是你必须了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry ifl alarmed your son. butyou must understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.12,0:33:48.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,手镯戴上到魔蝎大帝醒过来 我们只有七天的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that the bracelet's on. we have 7 days before the Scorpion King awakens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.16,0:33:49.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们?什么我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We? What we?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.63,0:33:52.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,他要是没死 就会招回阿努比斯的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifhe is not killed. he will raise the Army of Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.43,0:33:55.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 八成不是什么好事 - 是啊!他会消灭全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I take it that's not a good thing. - Oh. he'll wipe out the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.53,0:33:57.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,又是"消灭全世界"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old "wipe out the world" ploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.94,0:34:03.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀死魔蝎大帝的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whomever can kill the Scorpion King...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.01,0:34:05.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以送他的军队回地府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can send his army back to the Underworld...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.01,0:34:08.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,或者用他们来 消灭人类 统治世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or use it to destroy mankind and rule the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.81,0:34:13.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们挖伊莫顿出来 因为他可以干掉魔蝎大帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They dug up Imhotep 'cause he's tough enough to take out the Scorpion King.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.08,0:34:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就是他们的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is their plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.66,0:34:22.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,(大英博物馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.76,0:34:30.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,儿子 有重要的工作交给你 留下来保护车子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex. I got a big job foryou. Stay here and protect the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:32.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我可以 - 保护车子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I could do that. - Protect the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:35.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 我年纪小不表示我笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.Just because I'm a kid doesn't mean I'm stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.04,0:34:38.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:42.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,万一看到有人尖叫跑出来 那就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifyou see anyone come running out screaming. it's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.25,0:34:44.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还是留下来陪他好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybeyou should stay here and watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:46.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,你终于想通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nowyou're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:53.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要散弹枪吗? - 不 我习惯用机关枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want the shotgun? - No. I prefer the Thompson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.53,0:35:01.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我对你说… 我是来自东方的陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifl were to say toyou. I'm a stranger traveling from the east...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.83,0:35:06.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,在找寻我失落的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seeking that which is lost
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:09.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我会回答 我是来自西方的陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I would reply that I am a stranger traveling from the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.14,0:35:11.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我便是你在找寻的人 - 这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is I whom you seek. - Then it is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.81,0:35:14.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你手上有圣记 - 这个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have the sacred mark. - What. that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.95,0:35:17.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我在开罗孤儿院被印的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That got slapped on me in an orphanage in Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.48,0:35:20.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,那个记号表示你是人类的守护者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That mark means you're a protector of man...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.08,0:35:23.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,上神的战士法老的侍卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a warrior for God. a Medjai.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.15,0:35:25.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你认错人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. You've got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.92,0:35:28.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,(埃及文物区)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.17,0:36:12.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,哈夫兹先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Hafez.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.97,0:36:18.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们找到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.54,0:36:52.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏醒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.61,0:36:53.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏醒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.77,0:37:55.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莫顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imhotep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.17,0:37:57.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候了?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.81,0:37:59.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.47,0:38:03.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在是蝎年
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.38,0:38:04.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.41,0:38:05.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.21,0:38:33.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.31,0:38:35.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一点都不怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.58,0:38:39.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是安苏娜的转世
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.08,0:38:43.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是躯体
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.48,0:38:45.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.35,0:38:51.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会从地府招回你的魂魄
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.63,0:38:56.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的爱会再次延续
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.38,0:39:06.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.18,0:39:10.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,几年前 这样的场面会吓我一跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a couple ofyears ago. this would've seemed really strange to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.85,0:39:18.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莫顿主人一定会很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Imhotep will be much pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.03,0:39:29.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,手镯呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.83,0:39:32.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,手镯在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the bracelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.47,0:39:35.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.74,0:39:40.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,在黄金金字塔的顶端 有一颗巨大的钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the very top ofthe gold pyramid. there was a huge diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.08,0:39:41.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,有多大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How huge?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.04,0:39:44.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,大到能反射出耀眼的光芒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was so big. it would reflect the sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.55,0:39:46.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,招唤远方的旅客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wink at distant travelers...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.88,0:39:49.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,让他们迎向死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beckoning them to their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.32,0:39:53.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,有份礼物要送给你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.69,0:39:54.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,是她
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.99,0:40:02.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会高兴看到她死
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.84,0:40:12.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off!. Get off!.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.85,0:40:17.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,天哪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.11,0:40:18.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的死期到了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.82,0:40:19.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,你等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.05,0:40:22.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll putyou in your grave again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.69,0:40:25.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,可惜我们打算先杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our thinking was. not ifwe putyou in your grave first.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.53,0:40:28.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,烧死她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn her!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.79,0:40:29.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,你混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bast
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.21,0:40:46.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快开门啊! - 我在开啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open it! Open it! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.17,0:41:10.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快发动 - 快点!快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry up! - Come on. come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.74,0:41:13.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你弄断了 - 别吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You broke it! - Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.74,0:41:16.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,惊惶失措是我的专利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifthere's gonna be any hysterics. they'll come from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.98,0:41:23.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.72,0:41:38.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,(甲醛 危险)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.85,0:42:02.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. go. go. go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.72,0:42:04.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,聚集你们的骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.52,0:42:06.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,连结你们的肢体
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.52,0:42:09.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,抖落肌肉的尘土
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.46,0:42:12.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,听我号令
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.04,0:42:21.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,老天 不要又是这些家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. no. Not these guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.04,0:42:23.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,消灭他们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.35,0:42:32.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办?我们怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do? What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.85,0:42:35.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你问我?我只有8岁耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're asking me? I'm only eightyears old!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:46.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?老婆 他们不用门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey. whatyou doin'? These guys don't use doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.53,0:42:51.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell's Jonathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.01,0:42:58.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾力克斯 - 我的车怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alex! - What's the matterwith my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.01,0:43:01.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不找其他的交通工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was forced to find an alternative means oftransportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:04.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 双层巴士? - 是他的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A double-decker bus? - It was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.08,0:43:05.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 才不是 - 就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was not! - Was too!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.35,0:43:07.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快开车 - 就是 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just go! - It was too!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:25.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,天哪!我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. not my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.81,0:43:32.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌木乃伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. I hate mummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.21,0:43:35.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 高兴我在了吧? - 就像以前一样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Glad to see me now? - Just like old times. huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.15,0:45:16.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,转弯 转弯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn. turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.07,0:45:36.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Get out ofthe way!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.30,0:46:07.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.12,0:46:32.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,(注意桥高)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.53,0:47:12.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,舅舅 开得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great driving. UncleJon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.93,0:47:14.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.40,0:47:22.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.27,0:47:25.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我第一次坐巴士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was myfirst bus ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.55,0:47:36.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有你我怎么办? - 图书馆员都这么麻烦吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatwould I dowithoutyou? - Are all librarians this much trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.19,0:47:37.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 肉麻死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez. get a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.60,0:47:53.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.07,0:47:54.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,别叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.61,0:47:55.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.94,0:47:57.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.14,0:48:31.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.41,0:48:41.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在该去阿姆谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.85,0:48:44.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀死魔蝎大帝
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.45,0:48:47.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,有了他的军队 我们就可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.86,0:48:50.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,一起统治世界
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.49,0:48:52.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.63,0:48:54.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,有件事要向您禀告
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.46,0:48:56.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,审判之矛在他们手上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.63,0:48:58.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.10,0:49:01.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,等我们到了阿姆谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.97,0:49:04.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的法力就会恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.47,0:49:09.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,也就不需要审判之矛了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.95,0:49:45.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 不要替你儿子担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please do not fear foryour son. my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.15,0:49:47.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会伤害他的 他戴着死神之镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cannot hurt him. for he wears the bracelet of Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.99,0:49:50.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,他戴着手镯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex is wearing the bracelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.65,0:49:53.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说戴上以后看到 吉萨的金字塔 卡纳克的神殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he put it on. he said he saw the pyramids at Giza. the temple at Karnak.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.89,0:49:57.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,等他们到了卡纳克 手镯就会显示下一站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they reach Karnak. the bracelet will show the next step ofthe journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.83,0:50:02.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果不能比他们先到卡纳克 就没办法知道要去哪找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifwe don't get to Karnak before them. we won't know where to look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.97,0:50:04.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,看样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.00,0:50:07.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一张魔毯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iike we need a magic carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.78,0:50:22.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,(埃及 开罗)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.86,0:50:28.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莫顿主人和欧康诺 最后一次交手的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Lord Imhotep last encountered the O'Connells...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.79,0:50:32.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们害他失去法力 落入地府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they sent his immortal soul to the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.36,0:50:36.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,就算他法力再强他还是有弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As powerful as he will become. he is still vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.10,0:50:39.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有阿努比斯的军队 才能让他所向无敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Onlywith the Army ofAnubis will he be invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.94,0:50:42.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,他会需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hewill need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.61,0:50:48.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,随身带着这本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep this with you always.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.45,0:50:52.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,是亡灵黑经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Book ofthe Dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.92,0:50:55.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,好聪明的小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a bright little child.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.69,0:50:59.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈一定很想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother must be missing you terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.52,0:51:01.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要想看到她 就要乖乖听话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifyou wish to see her again. you'd better behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.06,0:51:04.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 我爸妈都拿我没辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady. I don't behave for my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.63,0:51:06.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么以为我会听你的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think I'm going to do it foryou?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.76,0:51:07.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.93,0:51:12.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为你爸妈不会在你睡觉的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Becauseyour parents wouldn't slip poisonous snakes intoyour bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.37,0:51:14.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,放毒蛇到你床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whileyou were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.34,0:51:17.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莫顿主人要见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Imhotepwishes to meet the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.21,0:51:22.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们看看你有多勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we shall see how braveyou are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.28,0:51:25.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心我的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. watch the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.68,0:51:27.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的手指头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! Me fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.82,0:51:30.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.82,0:51:35.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.13,0:51:37.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到我们要的东西没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you acquire what we asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.26,0:51:39.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We acquired it. all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.83,0:51:41.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.50,0:51:45.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是杀了两名陵墓守卫 才拿到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to kill two ofthose guards at the mausoleum to acquire it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.60,0:51:47.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,箱子被下了诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This chest is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.57,0:51:51.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,上面写着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says there is one...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.74,0:51:53.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,怨灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the undead...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.24,0:51:55.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,将杀尽所有开箱之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who will kill all those who open this chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.75,0:51:59.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 而且怪物 会吸干他们然后复生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. and the creature will suck them dry then become whole again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.85,0:52:01.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,这故事我们都听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've all heard this story before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.79,0:52:05.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是我听说九年前 找到箱子的老美全都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. but I heard the Yanks who found it nineyears ago all died.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.59,0:52:07.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且死的很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horrible deaths. theywere.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.89,0:52:10.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以呢… - 我们现在要十万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So with that in mind… - Wewant ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.73,0:52:11.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.53,0:52:14.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能打开箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.97,0:52:16.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,说好了五万的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agreement was for five.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.07,0:52:19.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 但是我们要十万 不然我们就卖给别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. well. we want ten orwe'll take it elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.97,0:52:22.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你敢… - 十万就十万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ifyou… - Ten will be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.64,0:52:24.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,各位 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me. gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.31,0:52:27.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.22,0:52:46.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你听得懂 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.66,0:52:49.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以你最好听清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.40,0:52:51.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是被选中的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is you who are the chosen one...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.80,0:52:55.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,要带我去阿姆谢的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you who will take me to Ahm Shere.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.77,0:52:59.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要是不肯呢? 我要是迷路…怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What ifl don't? What ifl get a little lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.08,0:53:04.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼 你很勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have strength. Iittle one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.52,0:53:09.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是你爸的儿子 但是有件事你不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You areyour father's son. but I know something you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.12,0:53:12.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,这只手镯是一份礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bracelet is a gift...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.39,0:53:15.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,也是一个诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.63,0:53:18.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,时间的沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sands oftime...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.09,0:53:20.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,已经开始从你身上留逝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have already begun to pour againstyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.87,0:53:26.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,这我早就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I already heard this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.04,0:53:28.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,从我戴上手镯起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the minute I put the bracelet on...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.40,0:53:31.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,到魔蝎大帝醒来 我只有七天的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seven days do I have before the Scorpion King wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.84,0:53:34.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你知不知道要是第七天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you also hear that ifyou do not enter the pyramid...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.31,0:53:36.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,天亮的时候你到不了金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the sun strikes it on that very morning
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.85,0:53:40.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,手镯就会要了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the bracelet will suck the life out ofyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.45,0:53:42.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,这我倒没听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That part I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.45,0:53:45.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 那我只剩五天的时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. wait a minute. That means I've only got five days left.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.79,0:53:50.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们最好不要迷路 你说呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I believe it will be best ifwe do not get lost. don'tyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.13,0:53:53.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爸会修理你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad is going to kickyour ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.74,0:54:02.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.38,0:54:11.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,各位请进 你们会拿到酬劳的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here. gentlemen. you shall receiveyourjust rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.58,0:54:13.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 别耍花样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tricks now. woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.85,0:54:16.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们别想拿箱子 除非我们满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not givin' up this chest till we're satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.39,0:54:19.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 你们一定会非常满意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. don't worry. There is much satisfaction to be had.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.93,0:54:30.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.97,0:54:38.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个房间…被诅咒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.84,0:54:42.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有完没完? - 没诅咒你会死啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it with you and curses? - He ain't happywithout a good curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.88,0:54:45.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,这被诅咒了 那被诅咒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is cursed. That is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.55,0:54:47.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it a rest. will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.45,0:54:52.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.46,0:55:04.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他要你打开箱子 快打开箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants you to open the chest. Open the chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:04.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.19,0:55:28.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,他去哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.56,0:55:30.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,他去哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.54,0:55:50.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maya!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.97,0:56:17.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,(魔毯航空公司)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.31,0:56:22.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是魔毯? - 别担心 他是专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is the magic carpet? - It'll be fine. He's a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.38,0:56:26.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.56,0:56:34.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,他果然记得你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He definitely remembers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.46,0:56:36.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,他只是有点害羞 强纳森 去拿行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a little shy. Jonathan. get our bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.99,0:56:39.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我现在没手拿 - 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. my hands are full. - Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.06,0:56:42.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 行 我去拿行李 - 我去安排我们的行程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right. I'll get the bags. - I'll deal with the flight details.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.03,0:56:47.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 老公 你不是精打细算的人 - 我们没时间精打细算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey. you're not a subtle man. - We don't have time for subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.17,0:56:52.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊西 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Izzy. come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.44,0:56:56.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好像不太想看到你 - 还没被他拒绝过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doesn't look happy to seeyou. - Never turned me down yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.48,0:56:59.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,不管你想干嘛 我都没兴趣 说什么都没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is. whateveryou need. I don't care. Forget it. O'Connell.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.38,0:57:01.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,每次碰到你都要吃子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time I hook up with you. I get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.55,0:57:05.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,上次是我的屁股 我心里还是有阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I got shot in the ass. I'm in mourning for my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.19,0:57:08.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 记得摩洛哥银行的案子吧? - 银行的案子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember that bankjob in Marrakesh? - Bankjob?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.46,0:57:11.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是你想的那样 - 就是你想的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not like it sounds. - It's exactly how it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.83,0:57:14.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我飞高 躲在逆光处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flying high. hiding in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.20,0:57:17.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,死白人打信号 叫我飞低接应他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thewhite boy here flags me down. so I fly in low forthe pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.20,0:57:19.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,下一分钟 我就中弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next thing you know. I get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.40,0:57:21.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我躺在路中间 肠子都跑出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm lying in the middle ofthe road with my spleen hanging out...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.77,0:57:24.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,他居然还在旁边 和肚皮舞女郎跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I see him waltzing up with some belly dancer girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.97,0:57:26.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,肚皮舞女郎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belly dancer girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.41,0:57:29.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 伊西 我们该好好聊聊 - 不会吃子弹就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Izzy. I thinkyou and I should talk. - As long as I don't get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.65,0:57:32.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,有完没完 这次会付你钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quityourwhining. You're gonna get paid this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.22,0:57:38.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你自己看一看 我要钱干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haveyou looked around here any? What do I need moneyfor?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.25,0:57:40.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要我往哪花?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell am I gonna spend it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.76,0:57:43.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没时间废话 我儿子不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna keep this short. My little boy's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.53,0:57:45.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何我都要把他找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna do whatever it takes to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.60,0:57:55.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要有金棍子 你想干嘛就干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifyou give me that gold stick. you can shave my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.74,0:57:57.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要我剃光头 刮腿毛都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wax my legs and use me for a surfboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.04,0:58:01.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,在的黎波里不是干过吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't we do that in Tripoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.64,0:58:04.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,对了 你的眼睛 怎么瞎的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say. by the way. when did you loseyour eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.22,0:58:09.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没瞎 只是觉得 这样比较有味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't. I just thought it made me look more dashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.52,0:58:13.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点 去准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.29,0:58:17.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我平常不是这样的 - 我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not catching me at my best. - Oh. I'm sure I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.87,0:58:28.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道 又要吃子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it. I'm gonna get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.81,0:58:32.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们是十二支法老侍卫队的队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the commanders ofthe 12 tribes ofthe Medjai.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.91,0:58:35.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,霍勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horus.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.78,0:58:41.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,宠物鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pet bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.58,0:58:44.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我最好也是最聪明的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My best and most clever friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.25,0:58:47.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,它会让队长们知道我们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will let the commanders know of our progress so that they may follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.31,0:59:07.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,万一阿努比斯的军队复活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifthe Army of Anubis arises...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.88,0:59:12.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们一定会尽全力阻止的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}theywill do all they can to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.15,0:59:16.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定伊西可靠吗? - 可靠当然可靠…但愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Areyou sure Izzy is reliable? - Yeah. he's reliable-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.52,0:59:24.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 漂亮吧? - 怎么是气球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't she beautiful? - It's a balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.59,0:59:26.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,是飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a dirigible.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.43,0:59:29.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的飞机呢? - 飞机早就落伍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's your airplane? - Airplanes are a thing ofthe past.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.57,0:59:31.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 伊西 你是对的 - 我是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Izzy. you were right. - I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.87,0:59:33.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要吃子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. you're gonna get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.67,0:59:36.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,它比你想像的要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's faster than she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.77,0:59:38.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且非常安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's real quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.51,0:59:42.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,非常适合偷袭 这是最好的一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect for sneaking up on people. which is a very good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.58,0:59:44.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非 我们要用你的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless. of course. we go with your approach
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.68,0:59:48.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,先冲进去 然后一阵扫射 害你朋友屁股中弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}barging in face first. guns blazing. gettin' your friends shot in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.12,0:59:54.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你们就是 要搞这么多飞机呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can'tyou people ever keepyour feet on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.37,1:00:44.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,欧康诺不肯相信 但是他正飞向他的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Connell does not want to believe. but he flies like Horus to his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.37,1:00:48.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错 非常有趣 告诉我黄金金字塔的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. very interesting. Tell me more about this gold pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.34,1:00:51.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,根据记载 从魔蝎大帝的时代到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is written that since the time ofthe Scorpion King...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.08,1:00:54.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,看过金字塔的人 没有一个活着回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no man who has laid eyes upon it has ever returned to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.35,1:00:56.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些事都写在哪?太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is all this stuffwritten? Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.26,1:01:00.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.96,1:01:07.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,很漂亮吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty nice. eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.70,1:01:10.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我唯一剩下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all I have left in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.07,1:01:12.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他的财产都输掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of my fortune was lost...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.20,1:01:14.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,是被一些无耻小人赢走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to some rather unscrupulous characters. actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.74,1:01:18.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,馆长的反应要真像你说的那样 那它一定非常重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifthe curator reacted the wayyou say. it must be very important.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.44,1:01:20.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是你 我会随身带着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifl wereyou. I would keep it close.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.88,1:01:24.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 神都别想把这玩意拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend. the gods couldn't take this away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.58,1:01:26.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我的 - 才不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's mine. - No. it's not!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.11,1:01:31.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,把你的手拿开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keepyour hands offit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.40,1:01:43.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 我好想他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him back. Rick.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.13,1:01:45.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要他回到我身边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.27,1:01:46.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.74,1:01:50.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,他很独立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We taught him well.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.77,1:01:53.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,他比你还聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.74,1:01:56.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,比我还坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's tougher than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.75,1:01:59.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我太爱他 我就是… - 我知道 我们都很爱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love him so much. I just can't… - I know. We both do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:01.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,儿子也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex knows that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.19,1:02:05.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我保证 我会把他找回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get him back. Evy. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.32,1:02:07.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knowyou will.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.12,1:02:36.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,到了没? 还没…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we thereyet? Are we thereyet?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.19,1:02:51.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦!瞄的真准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was amazing. Perfect aim.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.63,1:02:54.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What areyou talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.74,1:02:56.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我瞄歪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.55,1:03:06.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想上厕所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.61,1:03:39.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,上快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.19,1:03:47.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.23,1:03:53.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有厕所文学 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. reading material! - Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.67,1:04:01.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,有人看着我尿不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go when someone's watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.61,1:04:06.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信你 你会偷看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't trustyou. You'll look.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.95,1:04:16.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darn!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.02,1:04:21.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,脏死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.69,1:04:24.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,难道没有人知道怎么冲马桶吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't anyone around here know how to flush a toilet?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.16,1:04:58.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.82,1:05:26.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡纳克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karnak.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.00,1:06:09.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能接受过去的人 就没有未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If a man does not embrace his past. he has no future.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.86,1:06:12.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.07,1:06:14.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,就算…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.44,1:06:16.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经是法老的侍卫好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was some sort of a sacred Medjai...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.44,1:06:18.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,那和现在又有什么关系呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what good does that do me now?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.44,1:06:20.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the missing piece ofyour heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.64,1:06:24.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只要接受过去 没有什么可以难得倒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifyou embrace it. accept it. you can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.58,1:06:26.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,听起来不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.18,1:06:29.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有 我们该怎么对付伊莫顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. what can we expect from our old friend Imhotep?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.99,1:06:31.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,他法力恢复的很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His powers are returning quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.05,1:06:35.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,等他到了阿姆谢 恐怕连魔蝎大帝都杀不了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he reaches Ahm Shere. even the Scorpion King won't be able to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.54,1:06:54.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,该记起你的过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.41,1:06:59.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,记起我们的过去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.91,1:07:03.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的真爱
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.38,1:07:06.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,永恒的爱
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.75,1:07:08.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.69,1:07:10.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,相偎相依
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.96,1:07:12.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,直到永远
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.94,1:07:59.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,把面具带上
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.54,1:08:01.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,别划花你美丽的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.18,1:09:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,娜菲迪莉 你学的很快
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.61,1:09:16.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我该小心点了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.95,1:09:18.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.38,1:09:21.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也会小心的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.46,1:09:25.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,精采!精采!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.09,1:09:31.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,守护死神之镯的最佳人选
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.60,1:09:34.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可爱的女儿 娜菲迪莉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.07,1:09:38.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,保护我的最佳人选
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.44,1:09:40.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我未来的妻子 安苏娜
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.64,1:09:47.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,女儿 打得好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.98,1:10:54.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,法老
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.23,1:11:13.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,侍卫
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.77,1:11:16.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲需要你们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.53,1:11:41.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你快走!不要管我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.36,1:11:42.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.13,1:11:43.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有你才能让我复活
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.10,1:11:47.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能丢下你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.57,1:11:49.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.94,1:11:51.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,安苏娜
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.90,1:11:52.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莫顿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.71,1:11:58.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的身体已经另有所属
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.34,1:12:26.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莫顿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.44,1:12:28.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,安苏娜
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.72,1:12:39.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那些梦和幻觉 让你最近变得怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evy. I know you haven't been yourself latelywith these dreams and visions
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.62,1:12:42.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 那些是我前世的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. they're memories from my previous life.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.39,1:12:45.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是说真的 我现在终于明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly. I'm not losing my mind. It all makes perfect sense now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.29,1:12:47.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以我们才能找到手镯? - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's whywe found the bracelet? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.06,1:12:51.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是手镯的守护人 - 现在你相信了吧?朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was its protector. - Now do you believe. my friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.10,1:12:53.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,冥冥中注定 你是来保护她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly. you were destined to protect this woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.54,1:12:56.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,对啊!她是转世的公主 我是上神的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. She's a reincarnated princess. and I'm a warrior for God.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.81,1:13:00.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,而你儿子是到阿姆谢的向导 像金字塔的三面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son leads the way to Ahm Shere. Three sides ofthe pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.94,1:13:03.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,这都是前世注定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was all preordained thousands ofyears ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.85,1:13:05.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,故事的结局呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how does the story end?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.58,1:13:08.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有写过程 没有写结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the journey's written. not the destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.35,1:13:09.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,偷懒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Convenient.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.52,1:13:11.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,不然你怎么解释伊芙的幻觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How else doyou explain Evy's visions?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.65,1:13:14.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是你儿子戴上手镯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That it is your son who wears the bracelet?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.52,1:13:17.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么解释你手腕的记号? - 巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How doyou explain your mark? - Coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.26,1:13:21.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 巧合和命运只有一线之隔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend. there is a fine line between coincidence and fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.88,1:13:43.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,别玩花样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.59,1:13:50.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,别乱来 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on there. partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.93,1:13:55.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,等时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the time comes...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.46,1:13:59.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会非常乐意杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall truly enjoy killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.07,1:14:02.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是在那之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But until that time...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.64,1:14:05.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你最好对我好一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd better be a little nicer to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.71,1:14:07.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的水在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now. where's mywater?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.48,1:14:13.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,冰块呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No ice?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.19,1:14:20.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,不准他乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure he doesn't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.52,1:14:53.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们走了 我们慢了一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've gone. We've lost them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.88,1:15:09.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.28,1:15:21.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯留下了领带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex left us his tie...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.82,1:15:25.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,还堆了一座沙堡给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he made us a little sand castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.75,1:15:28.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,是菲莱神殿岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Temple Island of Philae.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.29,1:15:31.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们去菲莱了 - 好孩子 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They've gone to Philae. - Attaboy. Alex. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.00,1:15:45.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿布新贝尔神殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great temple ofAbu Simbel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.36,1:17:16.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,下面是蓝色尼罗河 我们已经出了埃及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Blue Nile down there. We must be out of Egypt by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.17,1:17:20.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,在远古时代 这些都是上埃及的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ancient times. all this still belonged to the upper kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.10,1:17:22.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,绿洲应该就在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oasis must be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.44,1:17:24.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会找到他的 他那么聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. We'll find him. He's a smart kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.31,1:17:27.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,会留记号给我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll leave us a sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.48,1:17:34.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,吓了你一跳?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprised to see me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.65,1:17:37.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,居然在留记号?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving bread crumbs. huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.16,1:17:39.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,洛克纳
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.69,1:17:42.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,放他下来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.33,1:17:50.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,希望你父母的旅途愉快
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.24,1:18:33.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦来啦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.26,1:18:47.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,霍勒斯 去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horus. fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.06,1:18:54.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊西 快往右转 右舵 转右舵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Izzy. come hard right! Starboard! Starboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.34,1:19:40.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们是不是有事情忘了告诉我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there a little something you forgot to mention. hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.15,1:19:46.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.43,1:20:07.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿姆谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahm Shere.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.75,1:20:19.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.95,1:20:27.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,又来啦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's back!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.99,1:20:32.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.94,1:20:47.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.71,1:20:51.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.02,1:21:00.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.36,1:21:02.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.97,1:21:12.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找到我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna go get my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.97,1:21:15.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后要尽快离开这里 你最好想办法修好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we're gonna want to get out ofhere fast. so make this work. Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.97,1:21:20.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你搞清楚 这东西靠瓦斯 不是热气 是瓦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand. This thing was filled with gas. Not hot air. gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.31,1:21:24.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要瓦斯才有办法飞起来 你要我去哪找瓦斯来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need gas to get this thing in the air. Where am I gonna get gas around here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.08,1:21:26.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,香蕉?芒果?还是泰山的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bananas? Mangoes? Tarzan's ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.82,1:21:29.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也许可以改用热空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I could finagle it to take hot air.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.29,1:21:33.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是你知道我需要多少吗? 根本不可能嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But doyou know how many cubic meters I'd need? It's too big!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.46,1:21:37.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你一定有办法 我对你有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifanybody can fill this thing up with hot air. Izzy. it's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.83,1:21:45.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,回来吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.84,1:21:49.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,霍勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horace
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.48,1:22:00.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 现在怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So. Rick. what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.85,1:22:02.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们先找一块高地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find some higher ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.77,1:22:23.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,霍勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horace
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.38,1:22:31.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我非走不可 - 去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must go. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.08,1:22:33.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 去通知队长我们在哪 - 你不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To tell the commanders where we are. - You can't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.42,1:22:36.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 万一阿努比斯的军队复活… - 我需要你帮忙找我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ifthe Army of Anubis arises… - I need you to help me find my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.06,1:22:44.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我先帮你找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then first. I shall helpyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.06,1:22:45.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thankyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.03,1:23:26.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,看 罗马军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Roman legionnaires.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.47,1:23:32.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,这边 18世纪的法国人 拿破仑的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here. turn-of-the-century French. Napoleon's troops.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.84,1:23:35.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,全是阿努比斯干的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the name ofAnubis did this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.40,1:23:58.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 听到没? - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hear that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.63,1:24:01.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.70,1:24:03.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,没什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.34,1:24:07.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的妈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myword!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.78,1:24:13.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们快来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say. chaps. Iook at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.25,1:24:17.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,缩水的头 真想知道他们是怎么弄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shrunken heads. I'd love to know how they do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.82,1:24:21.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,随便说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.36,1:24:28.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会用枪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You any good with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.73,1:24:32.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,三届的猎狐大赛总冠军 你会用刀吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three times Fox and Hound's grand champion. You any good with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.37,1:24:36.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很快就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll know soon enough...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.17,1:24:40.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀死阿努比斯战士唯一的方法是砍掉他的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the onlyway to kill an Anubis warrior is by taking offits head.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.24,1:24:43.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll remember that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.95,1:24:49.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,记住…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to remember to...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.92,1:24:54.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,枪托要抵紧肩膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just keep it tight in the shoulder and...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.46,1:24:59.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,事先瞄准目标 然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iead the target a little bit. and then...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.50,1:25:02.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,扣板机 不要用拉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}squeeze the trigger don't pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.90,1:25:06.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会瞄准的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.97,1:25:47.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.84,1:25:51.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!这下麻烦大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cripes. I'm in trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.38,1:25:54.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在可以杀他了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now may I kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.35,1:25:55.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.99,1:25:59.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在不需要小男孩了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.29,1:26:01.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 但是我们需要手镯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.26,1:26:03.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,要用它来释放阿努比斯的军队
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.60,1:26:04.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,手镯?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.76,1:26:06.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙就是手镯?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.39,1:26:08.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 把手镯拿来 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Retrieve that bracelet. - With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.45,1:26:24.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.82,1:26:38.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,有东西靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.48,1:26:52.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,散开
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.38,1:26:53.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,张大眼镜
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.31,1:26:53.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,提高警觉
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.92,1:26:59.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.68,1:27:03.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我丈夫和儿子都在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my husband and my son down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.85,1:27:05.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要让我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make me proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.35,1:27:08.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,放心 包在我身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today's that day. Evy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.23,1:27:14.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,别怕 他们伤不了我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.23,1:27:17.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,小孩呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.51,1:28:38.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Book!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.49,1:28:45.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.68,1:29:16.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.55,1:29:20.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,小朋友 时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time has come. my little friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.72,1:29:22.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.74,1:29:42.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 艾力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad! - Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.69,1:29:54.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.23,1:30:06.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,该脱手镯了 小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to remove that bracelet. my good son.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.34,1:30:07.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.78,1:30:19.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 后面 - 哇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Behind you! - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.80,1:31:44.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - Thank God for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.47,1:31:55.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们要牺牲自己来保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The two ofyou must sacrifice yourselves for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.71,1:31:59.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,神会奖励你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall be rewarded in heaven!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.06,1:32:15.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈 - 艾力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom! - Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.93,1:32:18.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 好枪法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shootin'. Tex.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.47,1:32:21.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那些小矮人是干嘛的? - 只是当地的土人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What were those creepy pygmy things? - Just the local natives.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.80,1:32:23.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定? - 我确定 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Areyou sure? - I'm sure. It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.91,1:32:27.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸 妈 快点 我们快去金字塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Mom. Come on. Dad. We have to get to the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.28,1:32:29.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要快点脱掉手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get the bracelet off now!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.28,1:32:31.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,别脱了 戴起来很好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it on. Looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.41,1:32:33.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你们不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. you guys. you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.58,1:32:38.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,天亮前到不了金字塔我就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll kill me if I don't get inside the pyramid before the sun hits it...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.42,1:32:39.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}today!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.55,1:32:41.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.19,1:32:46.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.13,1:32:49.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说没什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thoughtyou said it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.88,1:33:03.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Jonathan?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.56,1:33:16.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看 这里是埋葬场我们安全了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! There's a burial ground! We're safe! We're safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.56,1:33:19.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们越不过这些圣石的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll never cross those sacred stones!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.03,1:33:22.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定? - 我当然确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are sure? - Yes. of course I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.11,1:33:38.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.72,1:33:50.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等我! - 强纳森 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait for me! - Hurry up.Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.56,1:33:53.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.43,1:33:57.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是干嘛的? - 这是用来以防万一的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that for? - Just something in case ofan emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.02,1:34:15.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.59,1:34:21.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,儿子 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.10,1:34:33.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,跑 快点 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Come on. Alex. faster! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.47,1:34:37.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸 手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! The bracelet!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.87,1:34:40.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.63,1:35:04.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.60,1:35:07.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,当爸爸…不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not easy being a dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.07,1:35:12.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,对啊!但是你当的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. but you do it real good.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.11,1:35:14.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.13,1:35:36.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们到了 谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made it. Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.07,1:35:39.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊!好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.50,1:35:41.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.88,1:35:45.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.66,1:35:59.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eve
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.26,1:36:01.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eve
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.36,1:36:13.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 她不会有事的 对不对? - 她不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's going to be all right. isn't she? - She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.60,1:36:15.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,帮我看着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.14,1:36:18.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈不会有事的 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy's fine. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.14,1:36:21.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,你妈不会有事的 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother's going to be fine. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.81,1:36:25.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你那么坚强你不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're real strong. You're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.61,1:36:26.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.05,1:36:29.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.86,1:36:32.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办? 伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do? Eve
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.76,1:36:36.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.66,1:36:41.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart. no.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.10,1:36:44.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loveyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.34,1:36:48.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要离开我 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not leave me. no.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.78,1:36:52.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eve
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.98,1:37:03.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back. Evy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.79,1:37:08.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.09,1:37:10.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,你醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.70,1:38:23.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,巨神阿努比斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.47,1:38:25.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,收走了我的法力
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.67,1:38:30.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来他希望我以凡人的身份…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.21,1:38:31.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,来决斗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.68,1:38:37.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.67,1:40:07.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,终于开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.87,1:40:14.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 试着往好处想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to think of it like this. Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.71,1:40:17.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,她到更好的地方去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone to a better place.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.21,1:40:20.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 就像书上说的 - 那本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like it says in the good book. - The book!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.18,1:40:22.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 我想到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.08,1:40:23.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想到了 - 想到什么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it! - That's what?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.62,1:40:26.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点 舅舅 我想到了 那本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. UncleJon! That's it! The book!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.13,1:40:38.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,来不及了 欧康诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too late. O'Connell.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.40,1:40:40.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经释放了阿努比斯的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have released the Army of Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.37,1:40:43.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人会杀了魔蝎大帝 然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Imhotep shall soon kill the Scorpion King...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.77,1:40:45.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,控制一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and take command.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.87,1:40:47.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,他过得了我这关再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not after I get through with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.50,1:41:09.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我必须单独面对魔蝎大帝
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.34,1:41:11.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.70,1:41:13.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没有法力杀不死他的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.91,1:41:14.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不能阻止我们
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.07,1:41:17.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.81,1:41:21.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不要再失去你
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.02,1:41:32.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,你该知道 要能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You realize. of course. that this can only be done...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.05,1:41:34.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,读古埃及文才能招魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by someone who can actually read ancient Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.62,1:41:37.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是不知道你怎样 但我是有点生疏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know aboutyou. but I'm a tad rusty.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.86,1:41:41.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在呢? - 往右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now where? - We go right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.36,1:41:43.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How doyou know?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.87,1:41:49.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,意思是 此路通魔蝎大帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basically. "This way to the Scorpion King."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.74,1:41:52.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈教我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mum taught me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.54,1:41:57.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有希望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just might work.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.44,1:42:31.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,死女人 该有人教训你一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time someone taughtyou a lesson. wench. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.79,1:42:41.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要为我妹妹报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.48,1:43:35.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想杀了我?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.98,1:43:39.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后你想杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.29,1:43:42.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,送他的军队回地府
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.09,1:43:46.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不答应
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.80,1:44:32.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没吃饭吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.99,1:45:26.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点 艾力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up. Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.14,1:46:24.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,舅舅 我看不懂最后一个符号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}UncleJon. I don't know what this last symbol is!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.21,1:46:25.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.85,1:46:27.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,是一只鸟 一只鹤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bird. A stork!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.08,1:46:33.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 那个我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that one! I know that one!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.22,1:46:35.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.56,1:46:40.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.10,1:47:26.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,欺负男人你不丢脸吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don'tyou pick on somebody your own size?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.64,1:47:28.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.84,1:47:30.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 伊芙 - 带艾力克斯走 去帮瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Evy! - Take Alex. Go and help Rick.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.98,1:47:32.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈 可是… - 没有"可是"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But. Mom… - No "buts."
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.38,1:47:34.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.55,1:47:39.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.65,1:47:41.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 舅舅 我们成功了 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We did it. Uncle Jon! - Right. partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.72,1:47:43.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们去帮你爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let's go help your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.55,1:48:39.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的仆人
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.12,1:48:42.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的仆人
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.96,1:48:46.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,再看吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.59,1:48:52.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是来杀你的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.26,1:49:21.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,娜菲迪莉
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.99,1:49:24.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,安苏娜
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.23,1:49:26.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.68,1:49:43.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你恢复以前的身手了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.25,1:49:48.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是新招数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a little something new.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.48,1:50:18.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.25,1:50:22.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,救我!快救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save me! Save me!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.55,1:50:23.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.71,1:51:20.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,神啊!救救我们
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.43,1:51:49.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,好 现在我信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. now I'm a believer.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.81,1:51:52.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.11,1:51:55.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.78,1:51:56.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a spear!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.98,1:51:59.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,那根金色的棍子 是一支矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The golden stick thing! It's a spear!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.78,1:52:02.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的?看起来不像啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Doesn't look like a spear!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.05,1:52:05.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为要转开才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because it opens up into one!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.62,1:52:07.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?然后呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? And?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.06,1:52:11.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森 转开 就会变成一根矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It opens up into a spear!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.79,1:52:42.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,奋战到底!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.81,1:52:58.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.11,1:53:01.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eve.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.95,1:53:09.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 用力转 - 然后再推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twist it! - Push!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.58,1:53:10.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要用拉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.42,1:53:13.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,审判之矛
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.55,1:53:14.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan. quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.70,1:53:32.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森 快射他 杀了魔蝎大帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw it! Kill the Scorpion King!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.47,1:53:34.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,送他的军队回地府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send his army back to the Underworld!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.57,1:53:37.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,站到旁边去 我可是专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step aside. Alex. I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.96,1:53:54.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿努比斯的军队是我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.47,1:53:58.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.90,1:54:28.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.11,1:54:45.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧!叫你的朋友一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to hell. and takeyour friends with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.59,1:56:02.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.58,1:56:21.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eve.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.41,1:56:25.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快点走 不要管我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out ofhere! Just get out ofhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.75,1:56:27.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.46,1:56:33.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.50,1:56:47.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 撑着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on. Rick!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.45,1:56:59.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,安苏娜
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.92,1:57:01.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,救我!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.82,1:57:03.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,救我!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.36,1:57:07.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,安苏娜
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.13,1:57:13.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,安苏娜
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.78,1:58:05.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,往上爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go up!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.53,1:58:28.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,金字塔要沉下去了 我们往上爬!走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole damn place is gonna get sucked up! Let's move up! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.92,1:58:43.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.43,1:58:56.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,瑞克 没路走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick. we're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.58,1:59:09.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isidor
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.61,1:59:13.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,快上来 动作快 时间不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getyour butts moving! Hurry up! I haven't got all day!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.48,1:59:19.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,轮到你 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're next! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.99,1:59:29.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,强纳森 撑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.13,1:59:32.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快拉他上来!快拉 - 拉我上去!拉我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull him up! Pull him up! - Pull me up! Pull me up!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.13,1:59:38.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下 放我下去 放我下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait! Let me down! Let me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.14,1:59:41.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那不值得你去死 你疯了 - 值得 绝对值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not worth your life. you idiot! - Yes. it is! Yes. it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.51,1:59:46.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.92,1:59:56.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,拉我上去!拉我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull me up! Pull me up!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.44,2:00:19.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 欧康诺 我差点被你害死 - 至少你没吃子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- O'Connell. you almost got me killed! - At leastyou didn't get shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.28,2:00:21.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isidor
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.35,2:00:24.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thankyou! Thankyou!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.25,2:00:31.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,欧康诺 你这次又惹到谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Connell. who the hell haveyou been messing with this time. huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.49,2:00:32.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 还不就那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know. the usual.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.86,2:00:36.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,木乃伊 小矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mummies. pygmies...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.16,2:00:38.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,大虫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}big bugs.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.63,2:01:09.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我失去了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I almost lostyou there.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.63,2:01:11.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是失去了一下子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment there. you did.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.00,2:01:15.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,想知道天堂是什么样子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to know what heaven looks like?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.84,2:01:18.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,晚点再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.31,2:01:24.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托! - 拜托!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. please! - Oh. please!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.48,2:01:26.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 老兄 那一半是我的 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's half mine. you know. - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.68,2:01:30.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那一半是我的 - 我不知道你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's half mine. - What areyou talking about?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.08,2:01:32.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你拿了我的金棍子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took my gold stick!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.32,2:01:36.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我用我太太的头发誓 我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear on the head of mywife. I have no idea whatyou're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.66,2:01:38.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就没太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't got a wife!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.59,2:01:41.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也没拿你的金棍子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have your gold stick either!
